   <apex:outputPanel styleClass="slds-scope">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24px; color: #2E86C1;">Sticky Notes Package - Post-Deployment Steps</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #34495E;">Thank you for installing the Sticky Notes package! Please follow the steps below to configure and start using the app:</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #2874A6; margin-top: 20px;">Post-Deployment Steps</h2>
      <ol style="font-size: 16px; color: #2C3E50; margin-left: 20px;">

         <li>
            <strong>Add Colors to Sticky Notes:</strong>
            <ul>
               <li>Go to
                  <em>Setup</em> →
                  <em>Custom Metadata Types</em> →
                  <strong>Color_Code</strong>.</li>
               <li>Click
                  <strong>Manage Records</strong>.</li>
               <li>Click
                  <strong>New</strong> to add a new color.</li>
               <li>Fill in the details:
                  <ul>
                     <li>
                        <strong>Label:</strong> Enter a name for the color (e.g., "Yellow").</li>
                     <li>
                        <strong>Color Code:</strong> Enter the color's HEX code (e.g., "#FFFF00" for yellow).</li>
                  </ul>
               </li>
               <li>Repeat for additional colors if needed.</li>
            </ul>
         </li>
         <li>
            <strong>Assign Permissions:</strong>
            <ul>
               <li>Ensure that users have the appropriate permission set to access and use the Sticky Notes app.</li>
            </ul>
         </li>
      </ol>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #2874A6; margin-top: 20px;">Features of the Sticky Notes App</h2>
      <ul style="font-size: 16px; color: #2C3E50; margin-left: 20px;">
         <li>
            <strong>Create Notes:</strong> Users can create new notes to keep track of their tasks and ideas.</li>
         <li>
            <strong>Share Notes:</strong> Notes can be shared with other users in the same org. Shared notes are visible to the selected
            users.
         </li> 
         <li>
            <strong>Edit Notes:</strong> Any changes made to a note will reflect for all users with whom the note is shared.</li>
         <li>
            <strong>Delete Notes:</strong> Users can delete notes they no longer need.</li>
         <li>
            <strong>Change Note Colors:</strong> Users can change the color of their notes to organize and prioritize them better.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #2874A6; margin-top: 20px;">Need Help?</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #34495E;">
         If you encounter any issues or need assistance, please contact your Salesforce administrator or refer to the package documentation.
      </p>
   </apex:outputPanel>
</apex:page>